Description: AppIndicator and KStatusNotifierItem Support GNOME Shell Extension
 A GNOME Shell extension that adds AppIndicator, KStatusNotifierItem and
 legacy XEmbed Tray icons support to the Shell, so applications that only
 provide a tray icon keep working on modern GNOME desktops.
 .
 This package deploys the extension system-wide and keeps a per-user copy
 in sync on login, so the extension stays enabled across upgrades.
